[@1]
<h2>~lCellmate</h2>
<p>Psst hey.  You want out of here right?  Well we managed to keep a heal spell hidden away from our jailers.  It might be what you need to get past those acid barriacdes....
[@2]
<h2>~lCellmate</h2>
<p>If you can get to your island to the south you may have a chance.  Everyone is sleeping..even the guards!  So don't worry about any big response from them...The weapons are manned 24 hours a day so don't expect them to be idle.

[@80]
<p>~l~IHmm... Those guards could be a problem later on...better capture them.
[@200]
<p>~l~IThis could be a bit tricky...
[@320]
<p>~l~IThat sun workshop has just gotta go. 
[@430]
<p>~l~II wonder if I should take out those ice cannons....




